    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Outdated cli deps]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1065</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1065"/>
        <updated>2026-02-25T19:47:01.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Epic</h3>
<p dir="auto">There are currently only a handful of production dependencies in npm that are outdated.  This is our plan for getting them updated if possible.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">env-paths</code></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>required by <code class="notranslate">node-gyp</code> and will be updated in the next semver major of node-gyp (needs an engines update and is waiting on node 20 EOL I believe.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">iconv-lite</code></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>required through <code class="notranslate">encoding</code> by <code class="notranslate">minipass-fetch</code>.</li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3964342134" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/issues/181" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181/hovercard" href="https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181">npm/minipass-fetch#181</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">err-code</code> and <code class="notranslate">retry</code></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>required by <code class="notranslate">promise-retry</code>, which is used by:
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">pacote</code> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3970460329" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/449" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/npm/pacote/pull/449/hovercard" href="https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/449">npm/pacote#449</a></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">make-fetch-happen</code> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3970444930" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/issues/340" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340/hovercard" href="https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340">npm/make-fetch-happen#340</a></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">libnpmexec</code> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3970511409" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9008" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/npm/cli/pull/9008/hovercard" href="https://github.com/npm/cli/pull/9008">npm/cli#9008</a></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">@npmcli/git</code> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3970480770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/npm/git/issues/234" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/npm/git/pull/234/hovercard" href="https://github.com/npm/git/pull/234">npm/git#234</a></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">@sigstore/sign</code> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3986190431" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/issues/1578" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/sigstore/sigstore-js/pull/1578/hovercard" href="https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/pull/1578">sigstore/sigstore-js#1578</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>This package appears abandoned and the maintainer has no recent activity in github.</li>
<li><a href="https://npm.im/@gar/promise-retry" rel="nofollow">A fork</a> was made and we are moving to it.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">minipass</code> and <code class="notranslate">yallist</code></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>required by <code class="notranslate">minipass-flush</code> and <code class="notranslate">minipass-pipeline</code>.</li>
